A '''Dustybit''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found around the {{zone|Torrhus Springs}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Dustybits''' spawn on the land surrounding the {{zone|Torrhus Springs}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Dustybits''' walk or swim around before briefly standing still. If the player clicks on a '''Dustybit''', it will gain a green glowing effect and jump away with a trail of green particles up to {{Green|4}} times. If another player interacts with the '''Dustybit''', it will instead gain a white glowing effect. After the {{Green|4th}} jump, the '''Dustybit''' grows tired and drops a {{Item|Dustybit Shard}}.

The amount of times a '''Dustybit''' jumps can be reduced by the {{Attr|Frog Legs}} attribute.

